# Negative control — drops the `columns` pass-through from the Metric module to
# StatGroup, so a value declared in a config never reaches the library component.
#
# This is the mechanism whose absence produced a real defect: booking @1440 spilled
# "Unlimited" 24.8px into its neighbouring cell, because StatGroup's own column
# breakpoints key off the VIEWPORT rather than the container. The config-supplied
# `columns` is what corrects it, so a silently dropped pass-through reintroduces
# the spill with every gate still green.
#
# Authored by the developer seat, not the prover: building it needs the exact line
# the prop is forwarded on, and a prover that reads implementation source to write
# a mutant has breached its diff-blindness. The prover verifies it blind instead.
# Anchor asserted UNIQUE before mutating.
#
